OL,3,AThe rise of 'housefishing' - when does
OL,4,Ausing AI go from enhancing to
OL,5,Amisleading?
OL,6,
OL,7,FHave you ever been impressed by the
OL,8,Fpictures of a property on an estate
OL,9,Fagent's website, only to find the place
OL,10,Flooks completely different when you
OL,11,Fview it in person?
OL,13,FThen there's a chance that AI was used
OL,14,Fto enhance the images you saw.
OL,16,FFrom repainted walls to imaginary
OL,17,Flawns, estate agents are increasingly
OL,18,Fusing the technology to make homes seem
OL,19,Fmore appealing, arguing it helps buyers
OL,20,Fvisualise the potential of a place.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
