OL,3,ATimothee Chalamet among Hollywood stars
OL,4,Aand charity heroes stepping up for BBC
OL,5,AChildren In Need
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis year's BBC Children In Need show
OL,8,Fis taking place on Friday, with
OL,9,Fhighlights including Timothee Chalamet
OL,10,Fpranking Rylan Clark, and a "challenge
OL,11,Fsquad" of young people completing feats
OL,12,Fin the name of charity.
OL,14,FOscar-nominated actor Chalamet and
OL,15,Fco-stars Zendaya, Jason Momoa and Anya
OL,16,FTaylor-Joy will be seen making Rylan
OL,17,Fsweat during an interview for their new
OL,18,Ffilm Dune: Part Three, with the help of
OL,19,Fthree children, hidden behind the
OL,20,Fscenes.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
