OL,3,ATimothee Chalamet among Hollywood stars
OL,4,Aand charity heroes stepping up for BBC
OL,5,AChildren In Need
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe show will also feature Radio 2
OL,8,Fpresenter Owain Wyn Evans, on a
OL,9,F400-mile cycle challenge through
OL,10,FScotland, Northern Ireland, England and
OL,11,FWales.
OL,13,FLast year's appeal raised more than
OL,14,F#45m to help children and young people
OL,15,Facross the UK, and this year's TV event
OL,16,Fwill be broadcast from 19:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
